  <h2>About consulting procurement</h2>
  <p>
    Consulting tenders span built-environment professional services (architects, engineers, quantity
    surveyors, project managers, town planners), management and strategy consulting, IT advisory,
    organisational development, and internal audit and assurance. Built-environment work is typically
    procured under the CIDB Standard for the Appointment of Professional Service Providers and remunerated
    against tariffs guided by the relevant statutory council (SACAP, ECSA, SACPCMP, SACQSP, SACPVP).
  </p>

  <h2>Detailed sector hub — coming soon</h2>
  <p>
    We're building a detailed consulting-services hub covering the procurement frameworks used for
    professional services, the council registration requirements per discipline, the typical evaluation
    criteria (the CIDB methodology, NEC4 PSC, FIDIC White Book), and the link between consulting team
    composition and B-BBEE / specific goal scoring. Join the waitlist below.
  </p>

  <p>
